+#### `agent/request-messages` — waterfall
+
+Select logged request messages after prompt/input admission and header logging. The owner appends request/messages and confirms durability before returning its seq. Scope-filtered dispatch follows the owning Agent scope. Returning undefined delegates to the ordinary surface. This does not edit history.
+
+```ts cordis-catalog
+/**
+ * Select logged request messages after prompt/input admission and header logging.
+ * The owner appends request/messages and confirms durability before returning its seq.
